          %h3#general General
          %p The first indication of a 6d theory with a self-dual 2-form field appears in
          %ul
            %li#Witten95
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Edward+Witten"}> Edward Witten
              , section 1 of
              %em Some comments on string dynamics
              (
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9507121"}> hepth/9507121
              )
          %p
            Derivation of the abelian 6d theory to low order as the small fluctuations of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Green-Schwarz+sigma-model"} Green-Schwarz sigma-model
            of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M5-brane"} M5-brane
